<h2>New Contact Form Submission</h2>
<p>You have received a new message from the RevoShelf contact form.</p>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border: 1px solid #e4e4e7; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 14px;">
  <tr style="background-color: #fafafa;">
    <td width="30%" style="font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;">Sender Name</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;">{{name}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;">Sender Email</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;"><a href="mailto:{{email}}" style="color: #038F78;">{{email}}</a></td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="background-color: #fafafa;">
    <td style="font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;">Topic</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;">{{topic}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Message</td>
    <td style="white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.5;">{{message}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>Please reply directly to the sender at their email address listed above.</p>
